[00:16.12]1. Jehovah our God, exalted in might,
[00:24.12]Creator of life and Provider of light.
[00:32.12]Creation speaks of your power so grand;
[00:40.12]The heavens and earth forever stand.
[00:50.01]2. Your heavenly throne, on justice it stands.
[00:58.01]To us you make known all your righteous commands.
[01:06.67]And as we turn to your Word, we can see
[01:56.06]Your wisdom revealed so brilliantly.
[02:04.64]3. The greatest of all is your perfect love.
[02:13.23]Beyond all compare are your gifts from above.
[02:21.81]Your attributes and your glorious name,
[02:30.39]With joy and with zeal, we will proclaim.